          Our approach
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="divide-y divide-n600/40">
        <div class="py-10 first:pt-0">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-6">
            <div class="text-base text-accent">/ 01</div>
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-medium leading-[1.28] text-n100 lg:text-[50px]">
              Strong governance
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="max-w-[620px] text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            We believe successful industries are built on strong
            governance. A disciplined framework across the Group gives
            every subsidiary the structure it needs to grow with
            <span class="whitespace-nowrap">accountability.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-10">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-6">
            <div class="text-base text-accent">/ 02</div>
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-medium leading-[1.28] text-n100 lg:text-[50px]">
              Technology
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="max-w-[620px] text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            Technology-driven operations and shared expertise raise the
            standard of execution across the portfolio, from agricultural
            supply chains to live event delivery and property
            <span class="whitespace-nowrap">development.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-10 last:pb-0">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-6">
            <div class="text-base text-accent">/ 03</div>
            <h3 class="text-[26px] font-medium leading-[1.28] text-n100 lg:text-[50px]">
              Strategic partnerships
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="max-w-[620px] text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            Through shared expertise and disciplined execution, we enable
            each subsidiary to scale sustainably while creating long-term
            value for <span class="whitespace-nowrap">stakeholders.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

